    {
      "id": "p02-1",
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 2,
      "ar": "لَات",
      "en": "Laata"
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-2",
      "kind": "rule",
      "page": 2,
      "ar": "لات ليس رفع نصب",
      "en": "{{term|لات}} will govern like {{term|ليس}}. It gives its Ism {{ruling|رفع}} & its Khabar {{ruling|نصب}}."
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-3",
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 2,
      "ar": "لات",
      "en": "Exclusivities of لات"
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-4",
      "kind": "rule",
      "page": 2,
      "ar": "لات",
      "en": "1) {{condition|Both, its Ism & its Khabar MUST mean \"Time\"}} or {{condition|just its Ism must mean \"Time\"}}."
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-5",
      "kind": "rule",
      "page": 2,
      "ar": "لات",
      "en": "2) {{ruling|Its Ism or its Khabar MUST be dropped}}. Both can not be present at the same time. {{ruling|Dropping the Ism is preferred}}."
    },
    {
      "id": "p03-1",
      "kind": "example",
      "page": 3,
      "ar": "أُسكُتُوا لَات حِين تَكَلُّمٍ",
      "en": "e.g. Be silent, it is not a time of speaking",
      "labels": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p03-2",
      "kind": "example",
      "page": 3,
      "ar": "لَات (الحِينُ) حِين تَكَلُّمٍ",
      "en": "BOTH I/K = Time; الحِينُ is boxed; = JIK",
      "labels": [
        {
          "word": "لَات",
          "label": "المشبهة بليس"
        },
        {
          "word": "الحِينُ",
          "label": "اسم لات"
        },
        {
          "word": "حِين تَكَلُّمٍ",
          "label": "خبر لات"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p03-3",
      "kind": "example",
      "page": 3,
      "ar": "أُسكُتُوا لَات حِينُ تَكَلُّمٍ",
      "en": "Be silent, it is not a time of speaking (written again, with حِينُ)",
      "labels": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p03-4",
      "kind": "example",
      "page": 3,
      "ar": "لَات حِينُ تَكَلُّمٍ (ثَابِتًا لَكُمْ)",
      "en": "Only I = Time; ثَابِتًا لَكُمْ is boxed and the arrow points to it; = JIK",
      "labels": [
        {
          "word": "لَات",
          "label": "المشبهة بليس"
        },
        {
          "word": "حِينُ تَكَلُّمٍ",
          "label": "اسم لات"
        },
        {
          "word": "ثَابِتًا لَكُمْ",
          "label": "خبر لات"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p04-1",
      "kind": "example",
      "page": 4,
      "ar": "نَدِمَ زَيْدٌ وَلَات (الحِينُ) حِينَ نَدَامَةٍ",
      "en": "Zaid regretted, and it was not a time of regret; the arrow puts the dropped ism الحِينُ back in",
      "labels": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p04-2",
      "kind": "example",
      "page": 4,
      "ar": "نَدِمَ زَيْدٌ وَلَات حِينُ نَدَامَةٍ (ثابتًا لَهُ)",
      "en": "Zaid regretted, and it was not a time of regret; (ثابتًا لَهُ) is boxed",
      "labels": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p04-3",
      "kind": "rule",
      "page": 4,
      "ar": "حِين",
      "en": "Q. Does the word {{term|حِين}} need to be used all the time? A. No. {{condition|Any word which means time}}."
    },
    {
      "id": "p04-4",
      "kind": "example",
      "page": 4,
      "ar": "لَات ساعة تَكَلُّمٍ / زمَان تَكَلُّمٍ",
      "en": "e.g. it is not an hour of speaking / a time of speaking",
      "labels": []
